{"id":"question.pulmonology.pulmonary-hypertension.hemodynamics.002","kind":"original_concept_question","lessonId":"pulmonology.pulmonary-hypertension.hemodynamics","media":{"items":[{"columns":[{"id":"c0","label":"항목"},{"id":"c1","label":"자료"}],"id":"question.pulmonology.pulmonary-hypertension.hemodynamics.002.media.table","rows":[{"cells":["mPAP","35mmHg"],"id":"r0"},{"cells":["CO","5L/min"],"id":"r1"},{"cells":["PAWP","10·20mmHg"],"id":"r2"}],"stage":"question","title":"독립 작성 증례·실험 자료","type":"table"},{"diagramRef":"diagram.pulmonary-pressure-flow-0844","id":"question.pulmonology.pulmonary-hypertension.hemodynamics.002.diagram","stage":"question","type":"diagram"}],"schemaVersion":"1.0.0"},"options":[{"id":"A","text":"5와3Wood unit이다."},{"id":"B","text":"7과7Wood unit이다."},{"id":"C","text":"9와11Wood unit이다."},{"id":"D","text":"두 경우 모두5Wood unit이다."}],"prompt":"두 가상 혈역학 자료에서 평균 폐동맥압은35mmHg,심박출량은5L/min으로 같다. 쐐기압은 각각10과20mmHg다. 압력–유량 그래프의 관계를 이용해 실제 저항을 각각 다시 계산한 것은?","verificationStatus":"editorial_draft_not_exam_validated"}